{"id":"a8df529f3d237dfe","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Relativized Constructibility","display":"df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility — ZFC Inner2 Relativized Constructibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility — ZFC Inner2 Relativized Constructibility","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-relativized-constructibility — ZFC Inner2 Relativized Constructibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7fffbf0fc82b6138\" href=\"?note=7fffbf0fc82b6138\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,A\\in V\">\\(M,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to L_\\alpha[A]\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to L_\\alpha[A]\\in V\\)</span> (relative constructible hierarchy, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7fffbf0fc82b6138\" href=\"?note=7fffbf0fc82b6138\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2RelativizedConstructibility}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2RelativizedConstructibility}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}constructibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner2RelativizedConstructibility}_S(M,A)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\bigr)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land M=L_\\alpha[A]\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}constructibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner2RelativizedConstructibility}_S(M,A)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\bigr)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land M=L_\\alpha[A]\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This set-valued predicate means that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a stage of the hierarchy over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; the full <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[A]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}L_\\alpha[A]\">\\(L[A]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}L_\\alpha[A]\\)</span> is a proper class and is not equated with a set parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"7fffbf0fc82b6138","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"7fffbf0fc82b6138","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to L_\\alpha[A]\\in V$ (relative constructible hierarchy, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false}